147
00:09:39,540 --> 00:09:42,380
而且像他这样巨型的身材也更容易感染上
And that men of his large stature are more susceptible to a wide array

148
00:09:42,540 --> 00:09:44,250
各种各样的致命病症
of life-threatening diseases.

149
00:09:45,460 --> 00:09:46,960
这就...对啦...
There you go...

150
00:09:53,640 --> 00:09:56,220
-什么事  -我在做一个快速调查
-What's up?  -I'm conducting a quick survey.

151
00:09:56,430 --> 00:10:03,360
你觉得这个向伟人致敬的集可敬与可爱为一体的小玩意 是低级趣味吗
Do you think this respectful and loving tribute to a great man is in poor taste?

152
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:13,320
没错
Yep.

153
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:19,870
-你觉得这个算低级趣味吗  -这玩意可以打转或耍把戏吗
-Do you think this is in poor taste?  -Does it spin around and do tricks?

154
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:22,330
-都可以  -那就是低级趣味
-Yeah!  -Then yeah.

155
00:10:23,500 --> 00:10:27,170
-你怎么看  -太好玩了
-What do you think?  -That is hilarious!

156
00:10:28,880 --> 00:10:31,930
把遥控器给我  我要把他开到女厕所去
Give me the remote control.I want to drive him into the girls' restroom.

157
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:35,510
结论已出  这不是个好玩意
All right, we're done. It's offensive.

158
00:10:46,520 --> 00:10:49,780
-下午好  各位  -你心情不错啊
-Top of the afternoon, gentlemen.  -You're in a good mood.

159
00:10:49,940 --> 00:10:53,570
新的一天已降临  我有了新的世界观  我发现
Well, it's a new day. I have a new outlook.You know, I realized

160
00:10:53,740 --> 00:10:58,700
我不用关心别人的事  我只需要多把心思花在自己身上
I don't need to worry about other people.I just need to think more about myself.

161
00:11:02,290 --> 00:11:05,290
天  我们要如何习惯全新的你
Oh, how will we ever get used to the new you?

162
00:11:06,750 --> 00:11:09,050
我很高兴你能放下  并向未来前进
Well, I'm glad to see you moving forward.

163
00:11:09,210 --> 00:11:13,760
伯特的研究做得不错  他受到表彰也是理所当然的
Bert did quality research.And he deserves whatever accolades he receives.

164
00:11:14,890 --> 00:11:18,010
怎么回事  你昨晚升级了他这机器人的软件吗
What is going on? Did you upgrade his software last night?

165
00:11:19,390 --> 00:11:21,060
他这是开启了自主学习模式
I think he might be learning on his own.

166
00:11:21,680 --> 00:11:23,560
看来机器人大叛乱指日可待
Then the robot uprising has begun.

167
00:11:25,400 --> 00:11:29,070
抱歉  我要去向伯特表达我的祝贺
Excuse me, I need to pay Bert a proper congratulations.

168
00:11:33,070 --> 00:11:36,240
《星际大战》中的金色机器人

169
00:11:33,070 --> 00:11:36,240
他不光长得像C-3PO 现在连走路都一模一样了
He doesn't just look like C-3PO,now he walks like him.

170
00:11:38,620 --> 00:11:42,080
伯特  我想让你知道  我读了你的论文
Bert? I wanted to let you know that I read your research,

171
00:11:42,410 --> 00:11:44,920
你拿奖  实至名归
and your award is well-deserved.

172
00:11:45,540 --> 00:11:50,380
谢谢  最近我听了好多类似的话 自从我得奖  大家都夸我棒棒哒
Thanks.I've been hearing that a lot.Ever since I won, people think I'm great.

173
00:11:52,420 --> 00:11:55,930
好吧  仅此一次  你可以把我和大家混为一谈
Well, just this once,you can count me as people, too.

174
00:11:59,180 --> 00:12:01,640
作为麦克阿瑟奖学金获得者
You know, as a MacArthur Grant winner,

175
00:12:01,810 --> 00:12:04,060
我可以提名下一届的候选人
I'm allowed to nominate someone for next year.

176
00:12:04,230 --> 00:12:07,860
真的吗  我还不知道这件事呢
Really? I didn't know that.

177
00:12:08,110 --> 00:12:11,610
我想了一下  工程师好像一直不受重视
So I was thinking, you know, engineers don't get a lot of respect.

178
00:12:11,780 --> 00:12:14,700
你朋友霍华德有在研究什么有趣的东西吗
Is your friend Howard working on anything cool?

179
00:12:17,490 --> 00:12:22,290
我  我不确定  这你得问他了  失陪一下
You know, I-I'm not sure.You know, you'd have to ask him.Excuse me.

180
00:12:34,260 --> 00:12:37,840
莱纳德  我又伤了自己
Leonard! I hurt myself again.

181
00:12:39,550 --> 00:12:42,600
不好意思  我得去拍点照片了
Excuse me, I-I have to go take some pictures.

182
00:12:45,230 --> 00:12:47,520
真不敢相信你居然用头去撞饮水器
I can't believe you head-butted a water fountain.

183
00:12:49,940 --> 00:12:53,030
不  我本打算一拳砸在饮水器上
No, I went to punch the water fountain,

184
00:12:53,190 --> 00:12:55,490
结果踩到饮水器前一滩水滑倒
slipped in water in front of the water fountain,

185
00:12:55,650 --> 00:12:58,320
才一头撞上饮水器
and hit my head on the water fountain.

186
00:12:59,160 --> 00:13:01,030
我真想象不出你暴力的样子
I can't imagine you being violent.

187
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:03,370
也没那么难  想象一下"三个臭皮匠"的表演
It's not hard. Just picture the Three Stooges,

188
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:05,200
美国50年代搞笑组合

189
00:13:03,540 --> 00:13:05,200
然后去掉两个臭皮匠
and then take away two stooges.

190
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:11,540
我对自己太失望了  嫉妒真是毫无逻辑可言
I'm so disappointed in myself.Jealousy is completely illogical.

191
00:13:11,710 --> 00:13:14,840
这是人类的正常感情  谢尔顿  每个人都会嫉妒
It's a human emotion, Sheldon.Everyone gets jealous.

192
00:13:15,050 --> 00:13:17,340
我就很嫉妒莱纳德和佩妮  霍华德和伯纳黛特之间
I'm jealous of Leonard and Penny and Howard and Bernadette

193
00:13:17,550 --> 00:13:20,760
-相亲相爱的关系  -不嫉妒我和谢尔顿吗
-for being in such happy relationships.  -What about me and Sheldon?

194
00:13:24,140 --> 00:13:25,140
有啦有啦
Sure.

195
00:13:29,150 --> 00:13:32,060
我一直都很嫉妒拉杰家底丰厚
I've always been jealous of how much money Raj's family has.

196
00:13:32,270 --> 00:13:33,820
谢谢夸奖
Thank you for saying that.

197
00:13:33,980 --> 00:13:37,150
家底丰厚的好处  除了买买买  就是炫炫炫
Next to buying things,that is the best part about having money.

198
00:13:38,280 --> 00:13:41,700
自从我认识了佩妮  我就一直嫉妒她的美貌
Ever since I met Penny,I've been envious of her looks.

199
00:13:41,870 --> 00:13:43,370
谢谢
Aw, thank you.

200
00:13:43,660 --> 00:13:45,240
所以你剪短发时我才笑得合不拢嘴
That's why I was so happy when you cut your hair off.

201
00:13:45,410 --> 00:13:46,660
什么
What?!

202
00:13:46,870 --> 00:13:49,040
你懂我的意思
You know what I mean.

203
00:13:49,290 --> 00:13:51,960
虽然你依然美丽  但更像是"那位美女是疯了才剪短发吧"的那种美
You were still hot, but more like a "Why'd that hot girl cut off all her hair?" hot.

204
00:13:53,710 --> 00:13:55,710
你喜欢我的短发造型吧
You liked my short hair, right?

205
00:13:55,920 --> 00:13:58,170
是...我挺喜欢的
Yeah... I loved it.

206
00:13:58,340 --> 00:14:01,180
爱你  爱你的秀发  咱们换个话题吧
Love you, love the hair,would love to change the subject.

207
00:14:03,430 --> 00:14:05,430
说真的  你们都不喜欢吗
Seriously, none of you liked it?

208
00:14:07,180 --> 00:14:09,730
我觉得你很勇敢  这算是喜欢吗
I thought it was brave. Does that count as liking it?

209
00:14:12,230 --> 00:14:15,020
那怎么没人说起霍华德的傻逼发型呢
You know, how come nobody's talking about Howard's dopey haircut?

210
00:14:19,240 --> 00:14:21,530
-我觉得他挺可爱呀  -我觉得你也很可爱
-I think he looks cute.  -And I think you're cute.

211
00:14:21,700 --> 00:14:24,450
-我觉得你俩都好可爱  -我觉得我烦死你们这群书呆子了
-I think you're both cute.  -I think I hate all of you nerds.

212
00:14:31,670 --> 00:14:34,380
-抱歉  我走得太慢了  -没事
-Sorry I'm moving slowly.  -Oh, I don't mind.

213
00:14:34,920 --> 00:14:36,210
要是你现在能从兜里掏出颗奶油硬糖
If you pull a butterscotch out of your pocket,

214
00:14:36,380 --> 00:14:38,210
那就真是和跟我奶奶散步一模一样了
it would be like I'm walking with my grandma.

215
00:14:42,130 --> 00:14:43,140
不是吧
Oh, no.

216
00:14:42,130 --> 00:14:44,140
伯特伦·凯布勒  地质学教授  2016麦克阿瑟奖获奖者

217
00:14:47,930 --> 00:14:50,140
你看...  纪念牌
Did you... A plaque?

218
00:14:50,390 --> 00:14:52,810
没人想看这玩意儿
Nobody wants to see this.

219
00:14:53,770 --> 00:14:57,820
把"纪念牌"这词换成"跨种族伴侣"  你就是我奶奶无疑
Well, change "plaque" to "mixed-race couple" and you are my grandma.

220
00:14:58,280 --> 00:14:59,990
我再也受不了了
I can't take this anymore.

221
00:15:01,740 --> 00:15:04,990
伯特  伯特  伯特
Bert. Bert. Bert!

222
00:15:05,530 --> 00:15:07,660
-请进  -好了  我们上吧...
-Come in.  -All right, let's do this...

223
00:15:13,460 --> 00:15:16,040
伯特  我们得谈谈
Bert? We need to talk.

224
00:15:16,340 --> 00:15:19,840
-你这是怎么搞的  -石头  石头  饮水器
-What happened to you?  -Rock, rock, water fountain.

225
00:15:22,930 --> 00:15:27,050
这事说起来并不光彩  但我最近一直在嫉妒你的成功
I am not proud of this.But I have been envious of your recent success.

226
00:15:27,890 --> 00:15:28,970
哇哦
Wow

227
00:15:29,140 --> 00:15:31,980
我得了麦克阿瑟奖  大家都开始嫉妒我
I won the MacArthur Grant,everyone's jealous of me.

228
00:15:32,350 --> 00:15:35,100
等我把视力激光矫正手术做了  就别无所求了
Once I get Lasik, I'll be out of things to wish for.

229
00:15:36,860 --> 00:15:40,820
我是希望通过向你坦白我的弱点 卸下我心中的重担
I was hoping by admitting my weakness to you,I'd somehow be unburdened.

230
00:15:40,990 --> 00:15:42,110
轻松了吗
Is it working?

231
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:44,990
没有 现在弱点被你知道了  我对你的恨意更强烈了
No. Now that you know my weakness,I hate you more than ever.

232
00:15:46,450 --> 00:15:49,120
我们俩都很聪明
Well, you know, we're both pretty smart.

233
00:15:49,290 --> 00:15:52,330
要是我们能一起想  说不定能想出个办法呢
I bet if we put our heads together,we could come up with a solution.

234
00:15:53,870 --> 00:15:56,170
我们  等等  你是我的敌人
We... Hang on. You're my enemy.

235
00:15:57,000 --> 00:16:01,420
敌人的敌人就是朋友  现在  我最大的敌人是我自己
Now, the enemy of the enemy is my friend.And right now, I'm my own worst enemy.

236
00:16:01,630 --> 00:16:03,670
也就是说  你是我朋...  说吧  我洗耳恭听
That makes you my fr--  Okay, I'm good to go.

237
00:16:05,220 --> 00:16:07,220
太好了  既然我们是朋友了
Great. Now that we're friends,

238
00:16:07,390 --> 00:16:09,930
要不要试试去搞两张《艾伦秀》的观众入场券
want to see if we can get tickets to a taping of Ellen?

239
00:16:13,520 --> 00:16:17,440
-拉倒吧  这行不通的  -谢尔顿  等等
-You know what? This isn't gonna work.  -Sheldon... wait.

240
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:21,690
你可以高兴的事有很多
You know, you've got a lot to be happy about.

241
00:16:21,860 --> 00:16:25,280
在你的领域里  你是最棒的  还有一个那么棒的女朋友
You're at the top of your field,you have a great girlfriend.

242
00:16:25,450 --> 00:16:28,870
对啊  想起来了  我有艾米
Yes! That's right! I have Amy!

243
00:16:32,290 --> 00:16:35,290
过去你曾经喜欢过她
In the past, you've professed feelings for her.

244
00:16:35,500 --> 00:16:38,670
看着我拥有她  而你却望而不得  心里是不是苦死了
Does it eat you up inside that I have her and you don't?

245
00:16:38,880 --> 00:16:43,630
以前是  不过现在我已经名利双收了  应该可以找到更好的
It used to.But now that I'm rich and successful,I think I can do better.

246
00:16:46,840 --> 00:16:48,510
不敢相信  你居然打了伯特一拳
I can't believe you punched Bert.

247
00:16:50,390 --> 00:16:52,060
我没有挥拳打他
I didn't punch him.

248
00:16:52,220 --> 00:16:55,560
是趁他转身  我给他来了一招寇克船长的手刀
He turned around, and I gave him a Captain Kirk karate chop.

249
00:16:57,390 --> 00:16:59,100
都不知道他有没有感觉到
I'm not even sure he knows I did it.

250
00:17:00,730 --> 00:17:04,320
谢尔顿  我找到了或许能安慰你的人
Hey, Sheldon,I've got someone here who might make you feel better.

251
00:17:04,490 --> 00:17:05,740
你好  谢尔顿
Hello, Sheldon.

252
00:17:05,900 --> 00:17:07,700
霍金教授
Professor Hawking!

253
00:17:08,110 --> 00:17:11,830
我理解你因为事业上的嫉妒心而挣扎的感受
I understand you're struggling with professional jealousy.

254
00:17:12,120 --> 00:17:14,330
谢你啊  莱纳德  现在他觉得我不酷了
Thanks, Leonard, now he's not gonna think I'm cool.

255
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:21,250
别担心  我懂你的感受  我一次诺贝尔奖没得过
Don't worry, I know how you feel.I have never won a Nobel Prize.

256
00:17:21,590 --> 00:17:24,090
感觉好不公平啊
Oh, wow, that doesn't seem fair.

257
00:17:24,380 --> 00:17:26,880
没关系  我上过动画片《辛普森一家》
It's fine.I've been on The Simpsons.

258
00:17:29,090 --> 00:17:31,970
你怎么面对同事们的成功呢
How do you deal with the success of your colleagues?

259
00:17:32,180 --> 00:17:36,980
我提醒我自己 每一次科学进步  都是胜利
I remind myself every scientific advancement is a victory.

260
00:17:37,180 --> 00:17:39,900
而且我还上过《星际迷航》
Also, I was on Star Trek.

261
00:17:41,610 --> 00:17:45,820
那段可精彩了  他和牛顿玩扑克  你没兴趣
Oh, it was a good one. He played poker with Sir Isaac...You don't care.

262
00:17:46,990 --> 00:17:51,780
不要把你的时间花在嫉妒上  谢尔顿 对你的聪明才智是种浪费
Don't waste your time on jealousy, Sheldon, you're too brilliant.

263
00:17:52,450 --> 00:17:55,490
连史蒂芬·霍金都夸你聪明  你怎么还能难过呢
How can you feel bad if Stephen Hawking says you're brilliant?

264
00:17:56,080 --> 00:17:59,460
不难过了  谢谢你  霍金教授
I can't.Thank you, Professor Hawking.

265
00:17:59,620 --> 00:18:04,090
你就是人类之光  应该到处都有你的雕像
You are a gift to mankind. There should be statues of you everywhere.

266
00:18:04,300 --> 00:18:07,260
林肯纪念堂里的林肯像就有张椅子 应该直接把你换上去
You know, the Lincoln Memorial has a big chair.We could swap you right in.

267
00:18:10,300 --> 00:18:13,720
我总想  要是有我形象的机动玩具就好了
I always thought a motorized toy of me would be cool.

268
00:18:17,640 --> 00:18:21,940
多好的主意啊  怎么还不给这人颁诺贝尔奖
What a wonderful idea! How does this man not have a Nobel?

269
00:18:22,400 --> 00:18:24,770
-不要告诉沃洛威茨  -早想到了
- Do not tell Wolowitz. - Way ahead of you.

270
00:18:29,950 --> 00:18:34,660
新的研究成果表示  大笑能让你的大脑运转更灵活
A new study came out, and it said that laughing makes your brain work better.

271
00:18:29,950 --> 00:18:34,660
深受广大观众喜爱的《艾伦秀》现场 由著名主持人兼喜剧演员艾伦主持

272
00:18:34,830 --> 00:18:38,080
这是真的  因为我已经把自己笑成"最葱明"的人了
And I know that's true because laughing has made me the "Smartiest."

273
00:18:40,250 --> 00:18:43,000
不过话说回来  婴儿们也总笑  他们怎么那么笨
Although, on the other hand,babies laugh a lot, and they're dumb.

274
00:18:44,710 --> 00:18:47,710
她出名吗  她好讨人喜欢啊
Do people know about her? 'Cause she's delightful.

